<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Joy of the comfortless, light of the straying,</l><l>Hope of the penitent, fadeless and pure;</l><l>Here speaks the Comforter, tenderly saying—</l><l>Earth has no sorrow that heaven cannot cure.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Here see the Bread of Life; see waters flowing</l><l>Forth from the throne of God, pure from above;</l><l>Come to the feast of love; come, ever knowing</l><l>Earth has no sorrow but heaven can remove.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
